Package: yunmai-noble-full
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Vanuan <vanuan@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/Vanuan/yunmai-noble
Depends: yunmai-noble (= @VERSION@), yunmai-noble-desktop (= @VERSION@)
Suggests: yunmai-noble-simulator (= @VERSION@)
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Description: Yunmai Noble service and desktop client
 Metapackage that installs the complete Yunmai Noble application: the
 Bluetooth scale service with its web dashboard, and the GPUI desktop
 client with the simulator control app.
 .
 The virtual scale service for demos is not installed by default;
 install yunmai-noble-simulator to run it in parallel on port 3100.
